  "title": "Ukraine and Russia: US Envoys Meet Zelensky Amid Moscow Talks",
  "summary": "U.S. envoys Jared Kushner and Steve Witkoff meet Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky in Kyiv for talks on ending the Russia-Ukraine war. The talks aim to secure a ceasefire and address ongoing conflicts in the region.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "U.S. envoys Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner have met Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky in Kyiv for the first time since Russia's full-scale invasion.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The meetings were held in Sophia Square in front of Kyiv's historic Saint Sophia Cathedral.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Zelenskyy praised the U.S. envoys and expressed hope for a ceasefire and peace talks.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
